[[File:Npc_koboldsTox.png|333px|right]]Toxxulia Forest is a dark and quiet forest that encompasses much of the island continent of Odus. It is separated into two areas by a river running roughly east to west through it, the northern half more habited and the southern half controlled by the kobolds and the necromancers. If you are new to this area, check out the [[Erudin Starting Guide]].

